        </parameter>
        <parameter>
            <valueName>layer:SOREM:1.0:Broadcast_Text</valueName>
            <value>At 4:03 p.m. Central Daylight Time Saturday, Environment Canada has issued a marine tornado warning for Manitoba Lakes Manitoba. Extra care and attention should be exercised in the following marine areas: Lake Winnipegosis. Environment Canada meteorologists are tracking a severe thunderstorm that is possibly producing a tornado. Damaging winds, large hail and locally intense rainfall are also possible. Tornadoes are often wrapped in rain and may not be visible. Take cover immediately if threatening weather approaches.</value>
        </parameter>
        <parameter>
            <valueName>layer:EC-MSC-SMC:1.1:Designation_Code</valueName>
            <value>MB_00_01_WATR</value>
        </parameter>
        <parameter>
            <valueName>layer:SOREM:2.0:WirelessImmediate</valueName>
            <value>Yes</value>
        </parameter>
        <parameter>
